WEBVTT

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.314
If you have never practiced
critical thinking,

00:04:34.338 --> 00:04:38.051
then you simply see
what you're told to see.

00:04:40.395 --> 00:04:43.425
The biggest question also people ask me

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:46.904
is: "Why is there no revolution
inside North Korea?

00:04:46.928 --> 00:04:48.210
Are we dumb?

00:04:49.202 --> 00:04:54.151
Why is there no revolution
for 70 years of this oppression?"

00:04:55.531 --> 00:04:56.829
And I say:

00:04:58.305 --> 00:05:00.177
If you don't know you're a slave,